  (text "NOTA 1: Pinagem U1 (QFN32 5x5mm) verificada pino a pino no datasheet oficial Nordic"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "07201427-e0ea-48e7-bb7d-cda81e16491f")
  )
  (text "  nRF52810 PS, Table 99 (QFN32 pin assignments): DEC1=1, VDD=9/25/32 (tres pinos),"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e024c5ba-d56a-4260-9de9-ad04ca908ae8")
  )
  (text "  P0.21/nRESET=16, SWDCLK=17, SWDIO=18, ANT=19, VSS=20/29+die pad, DEC2=21, DEC3=22,"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0c82bba6-0a5e-4be4-a1b0-ee615ae246f0")
  )
  (text "  XC1=23, XC2=24, DEC4=30, DCC=31. Fonte: docs.nordicsemi.com/bundle/ps_nrf52810"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 205.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3f872949-0e40-4f8b-9027-a1dc91f29466")
  )
  (text "  (PDF nRF52810_PS, secao 7.1.2). NAO usar mapeamento QFN48 (pinos 33-43/VDDH)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 210.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5052a17d-1c9c-43f6-a741-8bfa18def744")
  )
  (text "NOTA 2: Casamento RF: ANT(19) -> no com C3 0.8pF shunt->GND -> L1 3.9nH serie -> ANT1 (2 elementos)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 215.9 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "96da93b7-7148-44ee-8b0b-d686cf9e18e4")
  )
  (text "  Ajuste fino obrigatorio com VNA na placa real (Nordic/Johanson: valores de EVB)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 220.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b81e2bdf-0b96-4068-8a9d-7ada7277c291")
  )
  (text "  Topologia conforme nRF52810 PS Fig. 146/Tabela 123 (corrigida vs netlist_conexoes.md em 2026-09-09; ver docs/verificacao_matematica.md claims 18/20)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a35ac55a-34ee-4f76-bfd3-0a940f933827")
  )
  (text "NOTA 3: Desacoplos/ladder DC/DC conforme PS Fig. 146/Tabela 123: DEC1(1): C5 100nF;"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 231.14 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "dc0dbdd2-7ade-41c6-babe-136b800554aa")
  )
  (text "  DEC3(22): C6 100pF; DEC2(21): C7 100nF DNP (pos. N.C. da ref.); VDD(9/25/32): C4+C8 100nF + C9 4.7uF; DCC(31) -L2 10uH- L3 15nH- DEC4(30) + C10 1.0uF."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 236.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "976bf09e-7ac4-435e-9eb3-e6f06f63c0e8")
  )
  (text "NOTA 4: 16 GPIOs nao usados pelo firmware: NC explicito (pinos 2-8, 10-15, 26-28)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 241.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c5a6813c-3ce8-45fc-8c59-ef3129fee470")
  )
  (text "NOTA 5: Layout: keep-out de cobre sob ANT1 e rede de casamento RF; plano GND contiguo na camada 2;"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 246.38 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d1ad641a-c856-4fa7-a58c-cbdbef6cc8dd")
  )
  (text "  die pad (33/VSS) com multiplas vias para GND; ferrite SHLD1 entre BT1 e TAG1;"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 251.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f24aacbe-7c90-450c-a3a6-10c6e720f404")
  )
  (text "  PCB 2 camadas 0.8mm. Cristal 32MHz CL=8pF com C1/C2 12pF NP0 (Ccap=2*CL-4pF)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 256.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "708e1e86-556a-4786-ad5a-45ae694fed9f")
  )
  (text "NOTA 6: R1 10k pull-up nRESET esta DNP: o nRF52810 tem pull-up interno (~13k); popular"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 261.62 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9d477926-7418-4426-b342-d97078ced90d")
  )
  (text "  apenas se houver ruído forte na linha de reset."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 266.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "66ae624b-70c0-452c-87dc-38d199c8e4a6")
  )
  (text "NOTA 7: ERC (projeto): pin_not_driven=ignore (nets XC1/XC2/SWDCLK/DEC* sao passivas por"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 271.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "98af24b4-2b4b-4b1f-98b2-c13bbfb1eeba")
  )
  (text "  design, sem driver a bordo - ref Nordic); footprint_link_issues=ignore (kicad-cli"
